  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_e840e8e2-cb86-4829-89e4-1090742b9876.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>這個材質包改變了盔甲和武器的設計（目前是基本款）。盔甲的外觀主要參考了 YouTuber Farfadox 的故事設定。希望大家喜歡，我會隨時有靈感時更新這個作品。</strong></p><h5>西班牙文原文：Este texture pack cambia el diseño de las armaduras y las armas (por ahora las básicas), el aspecto de las armaduras me basé principalmente en el lore del youtuber Farfadox, espero les guste, estaré actualizando el proyecto cada que me de inspiración.</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>感謝 12 萬次下載！！！！！</strong></span></h1><h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>我愛你們大家</strong></span></h1><h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_97e9c4cd-3ad1-4672-b5c3-7d47834a6a5f.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"230\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_fcbc9a50-6616-4b5a-b3b4-50262196cccc.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"229\"></h5><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_01ff85e6-a960-4e94-8618-80efe187223a.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"229\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_f0944130-5751-4a92-8112-8dd13025a6ef.png\" width=\"397\" height=\"230\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_e94f82dc-fc57-440f-8ebf-6e9ec440bc2b.png\" width=\"787\" height=\"463\"></p><div><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_e20486e1-19cc-41d9-a1a7-110f357ad1d5.png\" width=\"789\" height=\"464\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">銅器時代：</span></h2><div><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_dd8e7411-93ec-4767-ace2-11418b1a77d7.png\" width=\"375\" height=\"333\"></div><div><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982670/description_06a1547e-a67b-43bc-a3ea-4c